WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:03,020
After I finish dressing up for the wedding banquet, I will marry you.

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,620
I will work peacefully at the scene

3
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:08,340
Spend more time with you and less time in the mountains

4
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:11,510
I promise you

5
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:12,790
Eighteenth next month

6
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:15,150
I must stand in front of you with all my body and tail

7
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,870
I will marry you gracefully

8
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:27,220
Brother Qin went to Black Xiazi to get it tonight.

9
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,540
It is said that it is to prepare for the wedding banquet.

10
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:32,340
It’s too dangerous to go into the mountains in the middle of the night

11
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:36,840
A Tian is a man of great ability

12
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,040
He dared to go, but he felt low in his heart

13
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:42,210
He risked his life just to make you look good

14
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:46,770
This love must be sent to death

15
00:00:46,770 --> 00:00:50,010
Remember, this is rotten in your stomach

16
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:51,650
If the villagers ask

17
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:54,370
Just say that he went to the county machinery factory to do some work.

18
00:00:54,370 --> 00:00:56,490
No one should be allowed to know that he went into the mountains

19
00:00:56,490 --> 00:00:59,250
So as not to make people jealous, understand?
